    - Term: SoulSkill/908238/908238_Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Unlocks the ability to communicate with NPC animals. The interaction icons
        will appear above them as a visual cue for the player that the animals are
        interactable.
      - "Schaltet die F\xE4higkeit frei, mit NPC-Tieren zu kommunizieren. Dar\xFCber
